150 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (ANVUR is the independent national Agency responsible for quality assurance in universities, research institutes and AFAM institutions. The Agency was established in 2006 and began its operations in 2011, marking the culmination of a multi-annual reform process that aimed to strike a balance between the autonomy granted to universities and the implementation of internal and external QA procedures, designed to monitor and enhance the teaching and research activities of the institutions.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
