164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (ANVUR is committed to implement the action foreseen by Agreement on Reforming Research Assessment \(ARRA\) and has already started to reform its activities in the light of the ten commitments. In what follows the activities already carried out will be presented as well as the next steps planned for the period of 2024-2027. These are listed on the basis of the corresponding ARRA commitment. ANVUR Action Plan aims to contribute to develop a coherent approach to research evaluation both with reference to institutions, their internal scientific organization and to the careers of individual researchers. The Action Plan may also be considered as a reference standpoint for all Italian institutions that are active in the national research ecosystem.  )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3 4 5]
>>
endobj
