/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 474 0 R
/ActualText (VQR. Peer review based on well-defined criteria is confirmed as the standard evaluation method in the VQR 2020-2024. Peer review may be informed, where appropriate for the characteristics of the disciplinary field, by suitable quantitative indicators. However, quantitative indicators should not substitute for peer review. Specifically, according to the most recent regulation, ANVUR will continue to responsibly use citations and journal metrics as a support for the evaluation; however, the combined use of citations and journal-level indicators will NOT result in a predetermined suggested classification for the research output under evaluation.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
