/S /P
/P 475 0 R
/ActualText (Expert selection. The selection of experts in charge of evaluation in various procedures \(VQR, accreditation of PhD Programmes, journal assessment\) is based on an analysis of their CVs, which include some narrative elements, rather than relying automatically on quantitative indicators.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
