/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 492 0 R
/ActualText (Revision of VQR Criteria. ANVUR has revised the criteria for its periodic Evaluation of Research Quality \(VQR\). Specifically, the methodology for evaluating research outputs has been updated to consider efforts to ensure reproducibility, transparency in methods and procedures, and open access to data. This aims to fully valorise the entire research process leading to the final output.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
