/P 493 0 R
/ActualText (Selection and training of reviewers. For VQR 2020-2024, selection of experts in charge of evaluation has been based on a qualitative evaluation of their scientific merit based on a thorough analysis of their curriculum vitae. Experts are expected to participate to training sessions at the beginning and during the evaluation process.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
