<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 494 0 R
/ActualText (Revisions of criteria for journal assessment. The new regulation for journal assessment pays growing attention to research ethics, requiring journals to be classified by ANVUR to respect specific ethic rules. Particular attention is also devoted to preventing the inclusion of predatory journals in the ANVUR lists.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
