/P 498 0 R
/ActualText (VQR Expert Training. In the new national research assessment exercise, ANVUR has explicitly committed to provide adequate training to the experts in charge of the evaluation. This training is administered both in advance with respect to the starting of the research assessment exercise, and during the assessment process, in order to ensure a common understanding of the criteria set by the Agency and their correct application. The training will also focus on ethical issues concerning evaluation practices, with a particular emphasis on the managing of conflicts of interest and avoiding possible evaluation biases.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
