<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 499 0 R
/ActualText (VQR Transparent Communication. For the new VQR, ANVUR has made an effort to publish well in advance the general rules presiding the evaluation. More specifically, the Call for the new VQR has been published more than one year ahead of the end of the period that will be considered in the evaluation. Moreover, specific rules set out by disciplinary experts have been published more than six months in advance with respect to date in which the Institutions will start to submit research products for evaluation.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
