/P 503 0 R
/ActualText (G7. ANVUR participates to the G7 informal Working Group on research assessment. The member agencies of the Working group organize an annual meeting of their senior representatives responsible for evaluating research/S&T performance. The working group was initially tasked with of exchanging information on systems of research assessment and keeping the Heads apprised of best practices. Since that time, the group has continued to meet to share research assessment/ evaluation practices. These meetings provide a unique opportunity to engage colleagues from evaluation Agencies and granting councils, and to share challenges and best practices.)
