/ActualText (VQR 2015-2019 External Assessment. Starting from the Evaluation of Research Quality exercise referred to the period 2015-2019 \(VQR 2015-2019\), ANVUR has appointed a group of international experts in order to provide an external expert assessment of evaluation practices and criteria. The report produced by the experts has been published on the ANVUR website, together with and internal ex-post assessment of evaluation procedures.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
