/P 510 0 R
/ActualText (VQR 2020-2024. For the next evaluation exercise, referred to the period 2020-2024, ANVUR has formally committed to produce an external assessment at the end of the evaluation, appointing a renewed group of external international experts.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
281 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 511 0 R
/ActualText (Networking. ANVUR regularly participates in major international scientific conferences worldwide on research evaluation practices, including those organised by ISSI, AESIS, CHER, STI. This participation allows ANVUR officials to stay updated on the state-of-the-art of research in the field and exchange relevant practices.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
